    "Main 10 uses open 48-picture GOPs and repeated in-band parameter sets in hev1.",
    "Preserved ordinary x265 prefix SEI in hvcC and, for the Main 10 seed, samples.",
    "Main 10 converts the 8-bit source to 10-bit coding; it is not a 10-bit source-quality reference."
